(Burn Lottery: one free number per wallet with BETTEX in staking; extras are paid in BETTEX and) Tj T*
(fully burned. Payment is a BETTEX outflow: it resets prior weight and cancels all prior unpaid) Tj T*
(credits of the round; received USDC remains personal.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Double 2X: optional red-or-black game using USDC from already received earnings, without) Tj T*
(pending credits. One play every 24 consecutive hours, a 50/50 result, and no game fee. With 10) Tj T*
(USDC played, a win returns 20 total, a net gain of 10 paid by the treasury; a loss returns zero) Tj T*
(and sends the 10 to the treasury. A theoretical 100% RTP does not guarantee profit per play.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
