(100% of community token revenue goes to the treasury, with no service fees. The mint funds the) Tj T*
(project with accountability; external markets do not replicate the official swap.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Eligible result is split: 50% treasury, 25% staking, 25% buyback. Without eligible weights,) Tj T*
(reserves, or liquidity, 100% stays in the treasury. An authorized buyback permanently burns) Tj T*
(BETTEX; the exclusive wallet is not the burn mechanism.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Staking and liquidation) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Participants joining during ongoing rounds receive zero profit from that round, only the next.) Tj T*
(Balances and additions are fixed at the round's opening.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Weight = eligible opening balance  x  duration. Exits reset the weight and cancel prior unpaid) Tj T*
(credits; return occurs only in the next round. Additions do not change existing weights. Gross) Tj T*
(payment = staking portion  x  individual weight  /  sum of eligible weights.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Example: A starts with 1,000 eligible BETTEX; B receives 1,000 at 12:00. With eligible profit) Tj T*
(of 1,000 USDC and conditions met, the 250 USDC staking portion pays 250 to A and zero to B. In) Tj T*
(the next round, both eligible from opening and with no exit receive 125 USDC each on new) Tj T*
(eligible profit of 1,000 USDC. No prior profit is recovered.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Payments do not accumulate. Partial exits zero out rights. Non-executable fractions return to) Tj T*
(the treasury, with no future credit.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Credit depends on eligibility, authorization, and reconciliation. Round closing does not hold) Tj T*
(future credits or transfer presumptions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Only reconciled balances are available. Uncertain transfers do not trigger repeats or) Tj T*
(recoveries; corrections do not alter personal wallets.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Governance and integrations) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Policies evolve via version, with 2-of-3 multisig for custody. Critical changes require 24h) Tj T*
(notice; routines do not require new signatures; AI does not expand permissions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Treasury, operating cash, and wallets have clear boundaries. Defensive reserves follow policy) Tj T*
(without a 50% minimum. Operations require independent risk assessment.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
